---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoSyncPoolLifecycleDemo from '../demos/GoSyncPoolLifecycleDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gspl-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive tracer: sync.Pool per-P private/shared slots, victim cache, and leak traps" titleVi="Trình mô phỏng: sync.Pool per-P private/shared, cơ chế victim cache và lỗi quên Reset">
    <GoSyncPoolLifecycleDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Step through how sync.Pool serves P.private lock-free, keeps objects across one GC via victim cache before releasing on GC #2, and leaks cross-tenant secrets if buf.Reset() is omitted.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bấm từng bước theo dõi sync.Pool lấy từ khe P.private không cần khóa, giữ lại qua 1 chu kỳ GC bằng victim cache rồi xóa sạch ở GC #2, và tai họa rò dữ liệu khi quên gọi buf.Reset().</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gspl-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gspl-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gspl-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gspl .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .gspl .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gspl .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gspl .sd-stat b { font-size: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gspl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gspl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gspl-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gspl-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gspl-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .gspl-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gspl-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 22px; }
  .gspl-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gspl-note { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gspl-note p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
  .gspl-slots { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .gspl-slots { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gspl-slot {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;
    padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
  }
  .gspl-slot span { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gspl-slot b { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
